---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const updated = '4 April 2026';
---

<Layout
  title="Accessibility — Lili David"
  description="Accessibility commitment for lilidavid.com — barriers, standards, and how to get help."
>

  <section class="page-hero section a11y-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="label">Inclusion</span>
      <h1 class="mt-sm">Accessibility</h1>
      <p class="lead mt-md a11y-intro">
        This site is built so that as many people as possible can use it, including people who
        rely on assistive technology or keyboard navigation.
      </p>
      <p class="a11y-updated">Last updated: {updated}</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section a11y-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="a11y-body">

        <div class="a11y-block">
          <h2>Our commitment</h2>
          <p>
            CoherentOrgs SRL aims for this website to conform to the
            <a
              href="https://www.w3.org/WAI/WCAG21/quickref/?versions=2.1&levels=aa"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              aria-label="WCAG 2.1 quick reference on W3C (opens in a new tab)"
            >Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.1 Level AA</a>
            where reasonably achievable. We test with keyboard-only use, visible focus, semantic
            HTML, and common browser zoom levels.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="a11y-block">
          <h2>What we have implemented</h2>
          <ul class="a11y-list">
            <li>Skip link to jump straight to the main content</li>
            <li>Logical heading structure and descriptive link text where we control it</li>
            <li>Form labels tied to inputs; error messages exposed to assistive technologies</li>
            <li>Reduced-motion support for interface animations where applicable</li>
            <li>Sufficient colour contrast for body text and interactive elements</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="a11y-block">
          <h2>Known limitations</h2>
          <p>
            Some decorative motion and illustration effects remain on certain pages. If you use
            &ldquo;Reduce motion&rdquo; in your system settings, many of these are toned down or disabled.
            Third-party tools (for example booking or form services) have their own interfaces;
            we cannot fully control their accessibility.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="a11y-block">
          <h2>Help us improve</h2>
          <p>
            If you encounter a barrier &mdash; a page that is hard to use with a screen reader,
            missing focus, unclear labels, or anything else &mdash; please tell us. We will take
            it seriously and do our best to fix it.
          </p>
          <p>
            Email <a href="mailto:connect@lilidavid.com">connect@lilidavid.com</a> with
            &ldquo;Accessibility&rdquo; in the subject line and, if you can, the page address and
            what went wrong.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="a11y-block">
          <h2>Formal complaints</h2>
          <p>
            Depending on where you live and what laws apply to the service you are using, you may
            have rights to raise accessibility concerns with a national equality body, consumer
            organisation, or regulator. This site is a small-business professional presence; if you
            need a formal route, check guidance for your country. This is general information only
            and not legal advice.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="a11y-block">
          <h2>Related</h2>
          <p>
            <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>

<style>
  .a11y-hero {
    padding-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  .a11y-intro {
    max-width: 60ch;
  }

  .a11y-updated {
    margin-top: var(--space-sm);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .a11y-section.section {
    padding-top: var(--space-md);
  }

  .a11y-body {
    max-width: 70ch;
  }

  .a11y-block {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
    padding-bottom: var(--space-lg);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--stone-dark);
  }

  .a11y-block:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
    margin-bottom: 0;
    padding-bottom: 0;
  }

  .a11y-block h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.3rem, 2.5vw, 1.75rem);
    font-weight: 500;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
    line-height: 1.25;
  }

  .a11y-block p {
    max-width: none;
    margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
  }

  .a11y-block p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .a11y-block a {
    color: #3F5648;
    text-underline-offset: 0.18em;
  }

  .a11y-block a:hover {
    color: var(--eucalyptus);
  }

  .a11y-list {
    margin: var(--space-sm) 0 0;
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
    list-style: disc;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .a11y-list li {
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }
</style>
